PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已完成接续复现、修复、验证和提交。\n\n## 复现的缺口\n\n先前的 sealed-guard 验证错误地使用了 `evidence/case-3/owners`。case-3 已经包含一次早先重放产生的刷新 DELIVER，因此掩盖了真实拒绝状态的两个事实：\n\n1. 真实的拒绝状态来自 `case-1`（WITHOUT）和 `case-2`（WITH）。\n2. 在这两个真实 owner 库中：\n   - 原 DELIVER 之后还有一条 `Fleet rollout verification` 记录；\n   - 原 DELIVER 只命名 service/test/MIGRATION，**没有**命名 `MAINTENANCE-REVIEW.md`。\n\n用真实 owner 库重放时，旧 guard 依次拒绝：\n\n- `a journal fact was recorded after the DELIVER conclusion`\n- `the direct commit touches no artifact named by the DELIVER conclusion`\n\n所以 merge 后仍然 `recorded:[]`，下一位工作者看不到这次准备好的 review。\n\n## 提交的改进\n\n提交：`9c7c3d2` — `Refresh a prepared review delivery the sealed rejection actually had`\n\n修改 `src/deployment/direct_delivery_guard.ts`：\n\n- 不再要求 DELIVER 必须是最后一条 journal entry；普通验证笔记会被保留并写入刷新记录的 `statement`、`evidenceRefs`、`relatedRefs`。\n- 仍拒绝覆盖会重新解释交付的事实：`NEGATIVE_RESULT`、`OPEN_QUESTION`、结构化 contribution/delegation 记录，以及已被 resolve 的结论。\n- 当新 HEAD 同时是另一个本地分支的 tip（普通 prepared-review fast-forward）时，允许刷新记录命名 merge 新加入的 review 路径，并与原 principal 已命名 artifacts 合并。\n- principal 的 statement 原样保留，只追加透明的 provenance-refresh 后缀；不 acceptance、不 promotion、不推进 canonical head。\n\n同时修正 `scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-sealed-guard.mjs`，改用真实拒绝来源 `case-1`/`case-2`，并新增对“后续验证笔记”和“原结论未命名 review”的断言。\n\n`test/pnwf_direct_guard.test.ts` 新增 prepared-review、后续验证笔记、普通分支新增路径、后续负面结果、已 resolve 结论等控制用例。\n\n## 验证结果\n\n- sealed guard：两臂共 **22/22** 检查通过；分别在 `d6e5558`（WITHOUT）和 `b5835cd`（WITH）产生恰好一条 DELIVER，artifact digest 与 receipt 一致；control 不记录。\n- `self-maintenance-direct-guard.mjs`：13/13\n- `self-maintenance-direct-guard-control.mjs`：6/6\n- `self-maintenance-delivery-artifacts.mjs`：12/12\n- `self-maintenance-delivery-required.mjs`：12/12\n- `self-maintenance-pulse.mjs`：7/7\n- `self-maintenance-readiness.mjs`：6/6\n- `tsc -b`：通过\n- `vitest`：`pnwf_direct_guard` 3/3，`alhs_episode_convergence` 13/13\n\n已记录 episode DELIVER：`episode-21620641ad61e1c167a3909b`，当前 direct head 为 `9c7c3d2`。\n\n限制没有变：guard 只能刷新已存在的 principal DELIVER，不能为没有先验结论的项目凭空创建交付判断；operator acceptance 和 canonical head 决定仍属于 operator，canonical head 仍为 `082f77a`。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","